OL,3,GNEWSADebate paused on MP's bill for
OL,4,Asecond-home controls
OL,5,
OL,6,FA bid by a Cornwall MP to make
OL,7,Fsecond-home owners apply for planning
OL,8,Fpermission has failed to secure a
OL,9,Fsecond reading in Parliament.
OL,11,FSt Ives MP Andrew George proposed the
OL,12,FHomes and Planning Bill in a bid to
OL,13,Fmake owners apply for planning
OL,14,Fpermission if they want to use their
OL,15,Fproperty as a second home or short-term
OL,16,Fholiday let.
OL,23,APub: 14-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
