OL,3,GNEWSADebate paused on MP's bill for
OL,4,Asecond-home controls
OL,5,
OL,6,FHousing Minister Matthew Pennycook
OL,7,Fargued against the Lib Dem's private
OL,8,Fmember's bill on Friday, however,
OL,9,FPennycook told the Commons he was
OL,10,F"considering all options" to help
OL,11,Fpeople who live in seaside and rural
OL,12,Fcounties access housing.
OL,14,FMPs agreed to pause the debate and it
OL,15,Fwas adjourned until 15 January, however
OL,16,Fit is unlikely to become law without
OL,17,Fgovernment backing.
